Subject: [PATCH 24/32] fix: restore session ID, kaomoji, module loading lost
 in merge 4e2500b
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- src/app.ts: restore parseAppFlags, session ID, instance label,
  process title, PID file lifecycle — TsTuiMvpApp({ instanceLabel, sessionId })
- app-controller.ts: constructor opts, menus field, statusKaomoji,
  statusIdentity, kaomojiBlink blink timer, renderTopIdentity,
  renderTopKaomoji, getInstanceDisplayLabel — kaomoji top-right restored
- app-controller.ts: run() uses loadMicroapps + in-place menus mutation
  (menus.length=0; menus.push(...buildMenus())) so all 6 microapps
  register into the Applications menu after load
- menu-overlay-manager.ts: revert to static menus[] ref (mutation approach)
  instead of lazy getter — matches loadMicroapps mutation pattern
---
 src/app.ts                 |  37 ++++++++++-
 src/core/app-controller.ts | 133 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 166 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

